{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"sunshi-e-o032c","title":"杨弘张勋率袁术余众欲就孙策被刘勋要击","accounts":[{"id":"sunshi-e-o032c-account","label":"《孙破虏讨逆传第一》正文","text":"杨弘张勋率袁术余众欲就孙策被刘勋要击","evidence":["sunshi-e-o032c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sunshi-p0054","role":"率众","evidence":["sunshi-e-o032c-q"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0042","role":"率众","evidence":["sunshi-e-o032c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0168","role":"截获","evidence":["sunshi-e-o032c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"袁术僭号至死后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["sunshi-e-o032c-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"sunshi-e-o032c-q","source_order":[46,217,"O032c"],"order":8091}],"persons":[{"id":"sunshi-p0054","name":"杨弘","evidence":["sunshi-q-o032"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"sunshi-m-o032-sunshi-p0054","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["sunshi-q-o032"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"sunshi-e-o032c-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-5201386903331e2f3688","layer":"original","quote":"后术死，长史杨弘、大将张勋等，将其众欲就策；庐江太守刘勋要击〖21〗，悉虏之，收其珍宝以归。","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":43,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-o032","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-5201386903331e2f3688","layer":"original","quote":"时袁术僭号〖19〗，策以书责而绝之。﹝六﹞曹公表策为讨逆将军〖20〗，封为吴侯。﹝七﹞后术死，长史杨弘、大将张勋等，将其众欲就策；庐江太守刘勋要击〖21〗，悉虏之，收其珍宝以归。策闻之，伪与勋好盟〖22〗。勋新得术众，时豫章上缭宗民万余家在江东〖23〗，策劝勋攻取之。勋既行，策轻军晨夜袭拔庐江〖24〗，勋众尽降；勋独与麾下数百人，自归曹公。﹝八﹞","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":174,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
